    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a storm though. it doesn't feel like something that just passes. it feels like the truth. like i finally saw who i actually am and it's just... it's someone who ruins things. how can i ever \"recover\" from being a person who causes that kind of damage? it feels like i'm just stuck being this monster forever.",
