    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to feel better. it doesn't change the fact that i'm a net negative to the world. i look at the damage i caused and it's like... there's no version of the future where i'm not just a constant source of pain or risk to others. wouldn't it be more merciful if i just wasn't a factor anymore? like, instead of trying to \"fix\" a broken person, wouldn't it be better to just stop the damage at the source?",
